11
01:00:12,631 --> 01:00:18,631
Love Lies Bleeding is a 2024 romantic thriller film directed by Rose Glass from a screenplay she co-wrote with Weronika
Tofilska, and starring Kristen Stewart, Katy O'Brian, Jena Malone, Anna Baryshnikov, Dave Franco, and Ed Harris.

12
01:05:41,052 --> 01:05:47,052
It is an international co-production between the
United Kingdom and the United States.

13
01:11:09,473 --> 01:11:15,473
Set in 1989, the film's plot follows the lesbian relationship between a reclusive gym manager, who is estranged from her powerful father, a sinister
businessman with a criminal history, and an ambitious bodybuilder who gets wrapped up in the father's web of violence and coverups.

14
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
Love Lies Bleeding premiered at the Sundance Film Festival on January 20, 2024.

15
01:22:06,315 --> 01:22:12,315
It was released theatrically in the United States by A24 on March 8, 2024,
and in the United Kingdom by Lionsgate UK on May 3, 2024.

16
01:27:34,736 --> 01:27:40,736
The film received positive reviews from critics and was named one of the Top
Ten Independent Films of 2024 by the National Board of Review.

17
01:33:03,157 --> 01:33:09,157
The film explores themes of homicide, blackmail, fbi, new mexico, eroticism.

18
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
The tone is intense and dark and thought_provoking.
